<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said on Tuesday it cut its rating on Centocor Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Share in the company were up three at 26-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
